### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

###

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/68ef650a744bebcb51b05ae6

###

### Create new user (coach)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coach_john",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password_hash": "$2b$10$abcdefghijklmnopqrstuv",
  "role": "coach"
}

###

### Create new user (player)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coach_jane",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "password_hash": "$2b$10$xyznopqrstuvwxyzabcdefg",
  "role": "coach"
}

###

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/670c9c7b8f1a2b1e3c9d4f10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coach_john_updated",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com",
  "role": "head_coach"
}

###

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/670c9c7b8f1a2b1e3c9d4f10
